{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt;&gt;&gt; PLAYTESTS ARE AUTOMATICALLY ACCEPTED! &lt;&lt;&lt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>DEATHMOON</strong></i> is\u00a0a brutal roguelike boomer shooter set in an underground moon complex. Carve your way through layers of the moon with an <strong>arsenal of powerful weapons</strong>.\u00a0Use the <strong>tight and fine-tuned movement</strong> to your advantage to get out of tough situations.. <i>or just punch your way out of them.</i>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/677275f4c0c10c745db7ae305894fce4.poster.avif?t=1756231595\" width=480 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/677275f4c0c10c745db7ae305894fce4.webm?t=1756231595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/677275f4c0c10c745db7ae305894fce4.mp4?t=1756231595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired heavily by The Binding of Isaac, this game relies on <strong>synergies</strong> as its main fun factor. Every new weapon you find can be enhanced with either a <i>blessing</i> or a <i>curse</i> (or both) to offer a vast amount of variety. <br><br>Found the weapon of your choice? Now it's time to squeeze out all its potential with the ridiculous number of items you find across the complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/8611a1108e4aac4840635504baa59f83.poster.avif?t=1756231595\" width=400 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/8611a1108e4aac4840635504baa59f83.webm?t=1756231595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/8611a1108e4aac4840635504baa59f83.mp4?t=1756231595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your skill will be put to the test at the end of each layer. Show that you have what it takes, or die permanently. <br><br>When you manage to survive the dangers of the moon, grab yourself a rod and replenish your sanity. <i>You will need it down there..</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/1c020d03f85f3cee749ad7ebbe8b0d50.poster.avif?t=1756231595\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/1c020d03f85f3cee749ad7ebbe8b0d50.webm?t=1756231595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848800/extras/1c020d03f85f3cee749ad7ebbe8b0d50.mp4?t=1756231595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtest Features:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated rooms</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Pickupable weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 Weapon modifiers (blessings and curses)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Pickupable items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Layers, each with unique boss at the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing</p></li></ul>","ba